  ('assam-state-boxing-academy-sarusajai', 'Assam State Boxing Academy Sarusajai', 'Assam State Boxing Academy Sarusajai Guwahati. Accreditation: Boxing Federation of India (BFI) / Sports Authority of Assam. Coaching & Faculty: Amar Deka & Assam Amateur Boxing Coaches. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, AIBA Boxing Rings, Gym, Sports Science. Key Features: North-East India''s premier pugilism center following in the footsteps of Olympic medalist Lovlina Borgohain; Three Olympic competition boxing rings, specialized punch-sensor mitts, heavy teardrop bags, and hyperbaric recovery; 100% Free residential boarding scholarship with comprehensive protein diets, sparring gear, and tournament sponsorships. Program: U-19 Junior | Advanced | State Excellence Centre.', 'Guwahati', 'Assam', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('sai-training-centre-stc-udhampur-table-tennis', 'SAI Training Centre (STC) Udhampur Table Tennis', 'SAI Training Centre (STC) Subash Stadium Udhampur. Accreditation: Table Tennis Federation of India (TTFI) / SAI Northern Centre. Coaching & Faculty: Ramesh Sharma & SAI Northern Table Tennis Staff. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, Stag Americas Tables, Gym, Video Analysis. Key Features: Himalayan foothills table tennis academy fostering fast-reaction attacking play and multi-spin defensive mastery; 8 Stag Americas ITTF-approved tables on shock-absorbing Taraflex flooring with automated robot multi-ball drills; 100% Central government scholarship offering warm hostel accommodation, equipment rubbers, and education grants. Program: U-17 Sub-Junior | Advanced | Residential Sports Academy.', 'Udhampur', 'Jammu & Kashmir', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('kslta-junior-centre-of-excellence-bengaluru', 'KSLTA Junior Centre of Excellence Bengaluru', 'Karnataka State Lawn Tennis Academy (KSLTA) Junior COE. Accreditation: All India Tennis Association (AITA) / International Tennis Federation (ITF). Coaching & Faculty: Prahlad Srinath & AITA Master Professionals. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, Plexicushion Tennis Courts, Gym, Biomechanics Lab. Key Features: Historic tennis venue hosting Davis Cup ties and ATP Challenger events, dedicated to shaping India''s future grand slam hopefuls; 8 floodlit ITF-rated Plexicushion hard courts, PlaySight smart court video tracking, and tennis-specific speed ladders; 100% Merit-based training scholarships covering Babolat racquets, tour coaching travel, and fitness physiology. Program: U-19 Junior | Advanced | High-Performance Combine.', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('sai-stc-mayiladuthurai-kabaddi', 'SAI STC Mayiladuthurai Kabaddi', 'SAI Training Centre (STC) Mayiladuthurai Kabaddi Wing. Accreditation: Amateur Kabaddi Federation of India (AKFI) / SAI Southern Centre. Coaching & Faculty: G. Murugesan & Amateur Kabaddi Federation of India Coaches. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, Indoor Kabaddi Mats, Gym, Physiotherapy. Key Features: Delta region''s premier kabaddi talent center developing lightning-fast raiders and iron-clad ankle-hold defenders; Two international Pro Kabaddi standard EVA foam mats, digital scoreboard, speed gates, and resistance sleds; 100% Free residential scholarship providing hostel accommodation, balanced athlete diets, and Pro Kabaddi trial access. Program: U-19 Junior | Advanced | Residential Sports Academy.', 'Mayiladuthurai', 'Tamil Nadu', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('rajasthan-state-athletics-academy-bikaner', 'Rajasthan State Athletics Academy Bikaner', 'Rajasthan State Athletics Academy Dr. Karni Singh Stadium Bikaner. Accreditation: Athletics Federation of India (AFI) / Rajasthan State Sports Council. Coaching & Faculty: Girdhari Lal & Rajasthan State Sports Council Coaches. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, 400m Synthetic Track, Gym, Physiotherapy. Key Features: Desert region sports fortress training resilient endurance runners and throwers accustomed to challenging climates; 8-lane polyurethane synthetic track, dedicated javelin/discus throwing rings with safety netting, and video timing; 100% Free residential boarding scholarship with customized high-calorie diet, gear, and travel stipends. Program: U-19 Junior | Advanced | State Sports Hostel.', 'Bikaner', 'Rajasthan', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('sai-training-centre-stc-solapur-weightlifting', 'SAI Training Centre (STC) Solapur Weightlifting', 'SAI Training Centre (STC) Indira Gandhi Stadium Solapur. Accreditation: Indian Weightlifting Federation (IWLF) / SAI Western Centre. Coaching & Faculty: Dattatraya Shinde & SAI Western Weightlifting Staff. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, Weightlifting Arena, Gym, Physiotherapy. Key Features: Southern Maharashtra''s renowned weightlifting hotbed crafting junior national champions in clean & jerk; 8 Olympic weightlifting platforms with calibrated bumper plates, chalk stations, and wireless lifting velocity sensors; 100% Central government scholarship providing complete boarding, nutritional milk/eggs allowance, and sports kits. Program: U-19 Junior | Advanced | Residential Sports Academy.', 'Solapur', 'Maharashtra', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('kerala-state-athletics-academy-maharajas-kochi', 'Kerala State Athletics Academy Maharajas Kochi', 'Kerala State Athletics Academy Maharajas College Ground. Accreditation: Athletics Federation of India (AFI) / Kerala State Sports Council. Coaching & Faculty: Sunny Joshua & Kerala State Sports Council Mentors. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, Synthetic Track, Gym, Physiotherapy. Key Features: The sacred ground of Kerala athletics in the heart of Kochi, birthplace of international Olympians and Asian Games medalists; Synthetic track, laser measuring devices for jumps/throws, plyometric pit, and cardiovascular testing lab; 100% Free residential scholarship covering hostel accommodation, balanced Kerala sports nutrition, and university education. Program: U-21 Elite | Advanced | State Excellence Centre.', 'Kochi', 'Kerala', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('sai-ncoe-high-performance-judo-imphal', 'SAI NCOE High Performance Judo Imphal', 'SAI NCOE High Performance Judo Academy Takyelpat Imphal. Accreditation: Judo Federation of India (JFI) / International Judo Federation (IJF). Coaching & Faculty: Ch. Tombi Devi (Arjuna Awardee) & SAI Elite Judo Faculty. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, IJF Championship Tatami, Gym, Sports Science. Key Features: India''s supreme judo powerhouse nestled in Manipur''s capital, consistently delivering 60%+ of the national judo team; Quadruple IJF-standard tatami mats with video refereeing, judo-specific Uchikomi bands, and rapid-ice hydrotherapy; 100% Fully funded central scholarship covering international Mizuno judogis, specialized sports nutrition, and tour budgets. Program: U-21 Elite | Advanced | High-Performance Combine.', 'Imphal', 'Manipur', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('sai-ncoe-jawaharlal-nehru-stadium-delhi', 'SAI NCOE Jawaharlal Nehru Stadium Delhi', 'SAI National Centre of Excellence (NCOE) Jawaharlal Nehru Stadium Delhi. Accreditation: SAI National Centre of Excellence (NCOE) / World Athletics Category 1. Coaching & Faculty: Chief National Coach & SAI Elite Olympic Athletics Faculty. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, World Athletics Class-1 Track, Biomechanics Lab, Cryotherapy. Key Features: The 240th Milestone Landmark: India''s apex 60,000-seat national stadium and Olympic athletics high-performance nerve center; Twin 400m Class-1 Mondotrack surfaces, state-of-the-art National Centre for Sports Science & Research (NCSSR), and wind tunnels; 100% Government funded premier residential scholarship with global Olympic coaching staff, world-class lodging, and sports medicine. Program: U-21 Elite | Advanced | High-Performance Combine.', 'Delhi', 'Delhi', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('sai-training-centre-stc-bilaspur-athletics', 'SAI Training Centre (STC) Bilaspur Athletics', 'SAI Training Centre (STC) Bilaspur Athletics Wing. Accreditation: Athletics Federation of India (AFI) / SAI Central Regional Centre. Coaching & Faculty: K. R. Verma & SAI Central Athletics Mentors. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, Synthetic Running Track, Gym, Physiotherapy. Key Features: Central India''s prominent track academy scouting and grooming raw tribal athletic talent from the heartlands of Chhattisgarh; 8-lane synthetic track with automatic electronic timing, steeple-chase water jumps, and specialized field event sectors; 100% Free residential scholarship providing warm dormitory stay, nutritious diet, competition spikes, and schooling. Program: U-19 Junior | Advanced | Residential Sports Academy.', 'Bilaspur', 'Chhattisgarh', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('telangana-state-fencing-academy-gachibowli', 'Telangana State Fencing Academy Gachibowli', 'Telangana State Fencing Academy Gachibowli Stadium. Accreditation: Fencing Association of India (FAI) / Sports Authority of Telangana State. Coaching & Faculty: T. Ashok & Fencing Association of India (FAI) Mentors. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, Electronic Fencing Pistes, Gym, Video Analysis. Key Features: High-tech fencing academy housed in the world-class Gachibowli Indoor Stadium complex in Hyderabad''s IT corridor; Eight international standard metallic strips with wireless scoring boxes, video replay apparatus, and tactical strip cams; 100% State funded merit scholarship covering maraging blades, 800N protective uniforms, and national circuit travel. Program: U-19 Junior | Advanced | State Excellence Centre.', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('sai-training-centre-stc-kollam-hockey', 'SAI Training Centre (STC) Kollam Hockey', 'SAI Training Centre (STC) Lal Bahadur Shastri Stadium Kollam. Accreditation: Hockey India / SAI Southern Centre. Coaching & Faculty: K. R. Radhakrishnan & SAI Southern Hockey Coaches. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, Synthetic Hockey Astroturf, Gym, Physiotherapy. Key Features: Kerala''s premier coastal hockey citadel developing agile drag-flickers, playmakers, and quick-reflex goalkeepers; Full-sized blue FIH-certified water-based astroturf with floodlighting and digital penalty-corner trajectory analysis; 100% Free residential scholarship providing complete boarding, nutritious athlete meals, composite sticks, and kits. Program: U-19 Junior | Advanced | Residential Sports Academy.', 'Kollam', 'Kerala', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('mp-state-martial-arts-judo-academy-bhopal', 'MP State Martial Arts Judo Academy Bhopal', 'Madhya Pradesh State Martial Arts Judo Academy TT Nagar Bhopal. Accreditation: Judo Federation of India (JFI) / MP Sports Directorate. Coaching & Faculty: Kamal Singh & MP Sports Directorate Combat Mentors. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, Championship Tatami Hall, Gym, Sports Science. Key Features: State-of-the-art combat sports academy that has dominated National Games and Khelo India Youth Games judo podiums; Multi-ring Olympic standard tatami dojo, computerized video refereeing systems, and plyometric conditioning equipment; 100% State government residential scholarship including full boarding, customized high-protein nutrition, and gear. Program: U-19 Junior | Advanced | State Excellence Centre.', 'Bhopal', 'Madhya Pradesh', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('punjab-state-table-tennis-academy-jalandhar', 'Punjab State Table Tennis Academy Jalandhar', 'Punjab State Table Tennis Academy Hans Raj Stadium Jalandhar. Accreditation: Table Tennis Federation of India (TTFI) / Punjab Sports Department. Coaching & Faculty: Olympian Munish Chander & Punjab Sports Department Coaches. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, Enlio Table Tennis Arena, Gym, Video Analysis. Key Features: The sports manufacturing capital''s premier table tennis training arena shaping rapid counter-punchers and heavy top-spinners; 10 Stag Americas ITTF-approved tournament tables on Taraflex rubber flooring with double-head robot feeding systems; 100% Free residential scholarship providing comfortable athlete dormitories, wholesome diet, rubbers, and blades. Program: U-17 Sub-Junior | Advanced | State Excellence Centre.', 'Jalandhar', 'Punjab', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('haryana-state-boxing-academy-panchkula', 'Haryana State Boxing Academy Panchkula', 'Haryana State Boxing Academy Tau Devi Lal Stadium Panchkula. Accreditation: Boxing Federation of India (BFI) / Haryana Sports Department. Coaching & Faculty: Dharmender Singh & Haryana Sports Department Boxing Mentors. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, Olympic Boxing Arena, Gym, Sports Science. Key Features: Haryana''s elite boxing incubator located at the Shivalik foothills, known for relentless sparring and medal-winning technique; Three elevated competition boxing rings, digital punch-force sensors, high-speed camera feedback, and cryo recovery; 100% Free residential scholarship with complete boarding, almond-milk nutrition rations, leather gear, and national travel. Program: U-19 Junior | Advanced | State Excellence Centre.', 'Panchkula', 'Haryana', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('sai-training-centre-stc-bareilly-athletics', 'SAI Training Centre (STC) Bareilly Athletics', 'SAI Training Centre (STC) Sports Stadium Bareilly. Accreditation: Athletics Federation of India (AFI) / SAI Northern Region. Coaching & Faculty: Vinod Saxena & SAI Northern Athletics Coaches. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, Synthetic Running Track, Gym, Physiotherapy. Key Features: Rohilkhand''s primary track talent development center specializing in long-distance running, steeplechase, and javelin; 8-lane synthetic all-weather running surface with electronic photo-finish gates and cross-country training grounds; 100% Central government scholarship offering full residential stay, athlete nutrition, running spikes, and academic support. Program: U-19 Junior | Advanced | Residential Sports Academy.', 'Bareilly', 'Uttar Pradesh', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('tata-football-academy-tfa-jamshedpur', 'Tata Football Academy (TFA) Jamshedpur', 'Accreditation: All India Football Federation (AIFF) 4-Star Elite / Tata Steel. Coaching & Faculty: Noel Wilson & AIFF Pro / Tata Steel Youth Development Coaches. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, FIFA Standard Pitches, Gym, Sports Science. Key Features: India''s gold standard of youth football development since 1987, having graduated 140+ national team players and ISL captains; Three lush natural turf football grounds, floodlit artificial turf, tactical video analysis room, and rehab center; 100% Fully sponsored residential scholarship covering premium boarding, international exposure tours, and formal schooling. Program: U-19 Junior | Advanced | Corporate Sports Academy.', 'Jamshedpur', 'Jharkhand', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('sai-training-centre-stc-ballari-archery', 'SAI Training Centre (STC) Ballari Archery', 'SAI Training Centre (STC) District Stadium Ballari Archery. Accreditation: Archery Association of India (AAI) / SAI Southern Centre. Coaching & Faculty: H. M. Swamy & SAI Southern Archery Staff. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, 70m/90m FITA Range, Gym, Video Analysis. Key Features: Kalyana Karnataka''s premier archery hub crafting recurve and compound junior champions with meticulous precision drills; Regulation 70m/90m target range with electronic target buttresses, high-speed release capture, and bow-tuning workshop; 100% Free residential central scholarship covering Hoyt & Win&Win bow kits, Easton carbon arrows, and balanced diets. Program: U-19 Junior | Advanced | Residential Sports Academy.', 'Ballari', 'Karnataka', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('rajasthan-state-archery-academy-udaipur', 'Rajasthan State Archery Academy Udaipur', 'Rajasthan State Archery Academy Maharana Pratap Khel Gaon Udaipur. Accreditation: Archery Association of India (AAI) / Rajasthan State Sports Council. Coaching & Faculty: Dhanraj Choudhary & Rajasthan Sports Council Coaches. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, Olympic Archery Range, Gym, Sports Science. Key Features: Nestled among the Aravalli hills in the City of Lakes, harnessing indigenous tribal archers with Olympic recurve techniques; Expansive 90m archery arena equipped with weather-vane sensors, indoor shooting lanes for monsoon training, and physio; 100% State government funded residential scholarship providing boarding, elite bow equipment, and education stipend. Program: U-19 Junior | Advanced | State Sports Academy.', 'Udaipur', 'Rajasthan', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('sai-training-centre-stc-solan-judo', 'SAI Training Centre (STC) Solan Judo', 'SAI Training Centre (STC) Thodo Ground Solan Judo Wing. Accreditation: Judo Federation of India (JFI) / SAI Northern Region. Coaching & Faculty: Sanjeev Verma & SAI Northern Judo Faculty. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, IJF Tatami Mats, Gym, Physiotherapy. Key Features: Highland martial arts academy situated at 5,200 feet elevation developing extraordinary cardiovascular endurance and grip strength; High-density IJF certified tatami dojo with video match review systems and Olympic barbell power-lifting equipment; 100% Free residential scholarship providing warm dormitory lodging, customized athlete nutrition, judogis, and kits. Program: U-19 Junior | Advanced | Residential Sports Academy.', 'Solan', 'Himachal Pradesh', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('karnataka-state-badminton-academy-bengaluru', 'Karnataka State Badminton Academy Bengaluru', 'Karnataka State Badminton Academy (KBA) Jayanagar Bengaluru. Accreditation: Badminton Association of India (BAI) / Karnataka Badminton Association. Coaching & Faculty: B. R. Meenakshi & Badminton Association of India Master Mentors. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, BWF Synthetic Courts, Gym, Biomechanics Lab. Key Features: Historic temple of Indian badminton producing multiple national champions and Thomas/Uber Cup representatives; 10 BWF-approved Yonex courts on cushioned teakwood base, high-speed multi-angle stroke video, and fitness trainers; 100% Merit-based training scholarships covering accommodation, Yonex racquets, shuttlecock supply, and tour entry. Program: U-19 Junior | Advanced | State Excellence Centre.', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('sai-training-centre-stc-kurnool-weightlifting', 'SAI Training Centre (STC) Kurnool Weightlifting', 'SAI Training Centre (STC) Outdoor Stadium Kurnool Weightlifting. Accreditation: Indian Weightlifting Federation (IWLF) / SAI Southern Centre. Coaching & Faculty: M. Ramakrishna & SAI Southern Weightlifting Staff. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, Olympic Lifting Platforms, Gym, Physiotherapy. Key Features: Rayalaseema''s premier weightlifting power station training explosive snatch technique and clean-and-jerk mastery; 8 international competition platforms with calibrated Eleiko discs, Bar Sensei velocity sensors, and chalk stations; 100% Central government scholarship offering full residential stay, athlete nutrition, leather belts, and footwear. Program: U-19 Junior | Advanced | Residential Sports Academy.', 'Kurnool', 'Andhra Pradesh', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('west-bengal-state-table-tennis-academy-salt-lake', 'West Bengal State Table Tennis Academy Salt Lake', 'West Bengal State Table Tennis Academy Salt Lake Stadium Kolkata. Accreditation: Table Tennis Federation of India (TTFI) / Bengal Table Tennis Association. Coaching & Faculty: Arup Basak (Arjuna Awardee) & Bengal Table Tennis Mentors. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, Stag Championship Arena, Gym, Video Analysis. Key Features: Bengal''s crown jewel of ping-pong that has produced national champions and Commonwealth Games medalists for decades; 12 Stag Americas ITTF approved tables on shock-absorbing Taraflex flooring with automated multi-spin robot feeders; 100% Free residential scholarship providing comfortable athlete dormitories, high-protein nutrition, and tournament funding. Program: U-17 Sub-Junior | Advanced | State Excellence Centre.', 'Kolkata', 'West Bengal', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('sai-hatc-football-academy-dharamshala', 'SAI HATC Football Academy Dharamshala', 'SAI High Altitude Training Centre (HATC) Football Dharamshala. Accreditation: All India Football Federation (AIFF) / SAI High Altitude Training Scheme. Coaching & Faculty: Surinder Kumar & SAI Northern Football Coaches. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, High Altitude Turf Pitch, Gym, Cryotherapy. Key Features: Perched at 4,800 feet elevation beneath the snow-capped Dhauladhar mountains, enhancing VO2 max and aerobic stamina; FIFA-quality synthetic turf football pitch, hypoxic conditioning chambers, advanced sports physiotherapy, and cryo tubs; 100% Free residential central scholarship providing boarding, winterized dormitories, specialized diets, and kits. Program: U-19 Junior | Advanced | High Altitude Combine.', 'Dharamshala', 'Himachal Pradesh', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('maharashtra-state-shooting-academy-balewadi', 'Maharashtra State Shooting Academy Balewadi', 'Maharashtra State Shooting Academy Balewadi Stadium Pune. Accreditation: National Rifle Association of India (NRAI) / Maharashtra Sports Department. Coaching & Faculty: Gagan Narang (Padma Shri) & Elite ISSF Master Coaches. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, 10m, 25m, 50m Electronic Ranges, Armoury, Sports Science. Key Features: India''s premier Commonwealth and National Games shooting venue featuring 80 target points with Sius Ascor electronic targets; Full SCATT optoelectronic tracing, high-speed recoil dynamics laboratory, bespoke stock fitting, and mental conditioning; 100% Free residential merit scholarship covering Feinwerkbau match rifles, Olympic ammunition, and international travel. Program: U-21 Elite | Advanced | High-Performance Combine.', 'Pune', 'Maharashtra', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('sai-training-centre-stc-dimapur-archery', 'SAI Training Centre (STC) Dimapur Archery', 'SAI Training Centre (STC) State Stadium Dimapur Archery. Accreditation: Archery Association of India (AAI) / SAI North-East Centre. Coaching & Faculty: Imna Jamir & SAI North-East Archery Mentors. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, FITA Archery Range, Gym, Physiotherapy. Key Features: Nagaland''s premier archery nursery honing sharp visual focus, upper-body stability, and tournament calm in young warriors; Regulation 70m/90m target course with weather instruments, arrow spine deflection testers, and digital release cams; 100% Free residential central scholarship covering boarding, Hoyt recurve bows, Easton X10 shafts, and nutrition. Program: U-19 Junior | Advanced | Residential Sports Academy.', 'Dimapur', 'Nagaland', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('gujarat-state-aquatic-academy-sardar-patel', 'Gujarat State Aquatic Academy Sardar Patel', 'Gujarat State Aquatic Academy Sardar Patel Complex Ahmedabad. Accreditation: Swimming Federation of India (SFI) / Sports Authority of Gujarat. Coaching & Faculty: Kamlesh Nanavati & Swimming Federation of India Mentors. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, Olympic 50m Pool, Gym, Sports Science. Key Features: Gujarat''s premier competitive swimming center featuring an Olympic 50m 10-lane temperature-controlled racing pool; Omega quantum electronic touch pads, underwater high-speed stroke capture cameras, and resistance swim flumes; 100% State government residential scholarship including dormitory stay, specialized swimmer nutrition, and gear. Program: U-19 Junior | Advanced | State Excellence Centre.', 'Ahmedabad', 'Gujarat', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('sai-training-centre-stc-raipur-badminton', 'SAI Training Centre (STC) Raipur Badminton', 'SAI Training Centre (STC) Sardar Vallabhbhai Patel Stadium Raipur. Accreditation: Badminton Association of India (BAI) / SAI Central Centre. Coaching & Faculty: P. K. Verma & SAI Central Badminton Staff. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, BWF Badminton Courts, Gym, Physiotherapy. Key Features: Chhattisgarh''s apex shuttle academy developing rapid agility, explosive smashes, and deceptive drop shots; 6 BWF-approved synthetic rubberized courts on sprung wooden flooring with tournament LED lighting and match analysis; 100% Free residential central scholarship providing boarding, Yonex racquets, strings, footwear, and travel grants. Program: U-19 Junior | Advanced | Residential Sports Academy.', 'Raipur', 'Chhattisgarh', null, null, 'verified', 'published'),
  ('sai-nis-olympic-combine-patiala', 'SAI NIS Olympic Combine Patiala', 'SAI Netaji Subhas National Institute of Sports (NIS) Olympic Combine Patiala. Accreditation: Sports Authority of India / Asian Athletics Association / World Athletics. Coaching & Faculty: Chief National Faculty & SAI High-Performance Olympic Directors. Facilities: Hostel / Boarding, Olympic Synthetic Track, National Sports Science Centre, Hydrotherapy. Key Features: The 260th Milestone Landmark: Asia''s largest sports institute sprawling across the royal 268-acre Moti Bagh Palace estate; World Athletics Class-1 synthetic tracks, national biomechanics testing center, environmental altitude simulators, and recovery labs; 100% Premier government funded residential scholarship training India''s senior Olympic contingent and national record holders. Program: U-21 Elite | Advanced | High-Performance Combine.', 'Patiala', 'Punjab', null, null, 'verified', 'published')
